 {"id": "QA-BOARDCTL-3", "title": "QA chaos-resource: go test ./... OOMs under a 3G memory cap in the ci-pass container profile (INFO - brittleness, battery 2026-10-01)", "status": "complete", "priority": "P2", "reasoning": "QA foreman cycle 2026-10-01 - fresh-system CI pass + chaos on hermes4friends (cell chaos-resource). Under a 3145728KB cgroup cap the suite hits OOM ('ok ... boardctl/internal/workflowcheck' followed by FAIL on a later package). Harmless on unconstrained hosts, but the suite is not memory-flat: in any constrained CI runner or container the test run dies instead of degrading. Worth a t-scalable tag on the heaviest package or -p tuning; not a correctness defect today.", "created_at": "2026-10-01 12:26:05", "capability_tags": [], "worker_status": "complete", "commit_hash": "6dc6a63edefe8952680257dc82ad03fb509139ec", "guard_result": "PASS", "ci_result": "GREEN", "worker_summary": "3G-cap suite OOM fixed: (1) TestServeOversizeCap413 was materialising a 512MiB buffer (~1GiB RSS with the multipart copy) to reach a branch that refuses on ContentLength before reading — now posts a tiny body with honest oversized ContentLength-header; (2) TestVulncheck under an address-space cap (ulimit -v) could not start the govulncheck child at all — now skips loudly when RLIMIT_AS is finite (CI stays uncapped and enforces the gate). Verified: make test green under systemd-run scope MemoryMax=3145728K on this host (11 pkgs ok) x2, green uncapped, gofmt/vet clean. Tier1 guard PASS, Tier2 judge PASS (.gitreins/history/2026-10-02/62f97c91/verdict.json, id ca317865).", "complexity": null, "updated_at": "2026-10-02 02:35:00", "foreman_note": "Tick boardctl-2026-10-01-23-32-48. Repro->fix->gate-proven under cap; commit 6dc6a63 pushed origin/main.", "completed_at": "2026-10-02 02:35:00", "depends_on": [], "review_notes": "EVIDENCE /tmp/qa-20261001-boardctl.jsonl cell=chaos-resource: 'OOM under cap (expected for heavy suites, cap=3145728KB child_saw=3145728 ...): ok github.com/coding-hermes/boardctl/internal/workflowcheck ... FAIL'. REPRO: GOMEMLIMIT-free container with --memory=3g, go test ./... . Fix direction: identify the memory-heavy package, add t.Parallel tuning or split the heaviest test.", "type": null, "created_by": "qa-foreman", "worktree": null, "branch": null, "sessions": null}
