 {"id": "BT-072", "type": null, "priority": "P2", "status": "complete", "title": "SPEC: new web UI for boardctl — scope + specification", "detail": {"fingerprint": "ce358aa510c5196d942e6a0a99a0aba730b56257d7a24d28fccea7a5243613a1"}, "created_by": null, "created_at": "2026-10-01 22:58:02", "updated_at": "2026-10-02 03:56:07", "reasoning": "Define WHAT the boardctl web UI is before anything is built. Purpose: give humans (operator/Bane) a browser view of the fleet boards boardctl already understands, without hand-running CLI verbs. Decisions the spec MUST settle: (1) single-board vs fleet/multi-board; (2) read-only vs write posture (view+lint, or also edit rows?); (3) the reuse boundary with the EXISTING serve surface (uploader form, GET /api/boards listLoadedBoards, serveBoardIdentity, DF-BOARDCTL-2 dedupe) vs a new boardctl ui verb; (4) auth/bind posture (local-only vs operator token vs LAN/Tailscale); (5) which boardctl capabilities get a UI (validate status, row table, events timeline, sweep-status, render, dedupe); (6) how it honors the provide-dont-force doctrine (a tool the agent CHOOSES, nothing enforced). DELIVERABLE: docs/web-ui-spec.md — numbered, each requirement testable, plus explicit NON-GOALS. ACCEPTANCE: spec committed; reuse-vs-new decided with a named reason; single-vs-fleet decided; read-vs-write decided; every requirement names its acceptance test; no requirement rests on an undecided item.", "complexity": 2, "worker_status": "complete", "commit_hash": "ded9f67", "guard_result": "PASS", "ci_result": "GREEN", "worker_summary": "docs/web-ui-spec.md (450 lines, commit ded9f67, merged c84fc1e, pushed 0-behind). Worker glm-5.3-flash@zai-glm in worktree boardctl-BT-072. Spec: D1 EXTEND serve (4 named reasons), D2 fleet, D3 read-only, D4 loopback/no-auth, D5/D6 capability inventory + provide-dont-force testable; 10 ground-truth facts grep-verified against serve.go; R1-R20 each with named acceptance test; NG1-NG12 NON-GOALS. Foreman AC sweep + guard PASS. Tier-2 judge PASS.", "foreman_note": "Judge verdict: .gitreins/history/2026-10-02/a333f470/verdict.json (printed id ad92dbeb; first run 9eb6b7ec FAILed on the delivered-tree conjunct pre-merge — merge+push then re-judge per tick-88 ordering, PASS on identical tree). Worktree reapplied. Event ids may shift with gitreins rows.", "completed_at": "2026-10-02 03:56:07", "worktree": "/home/kara/worktrees/boardctl-BT-072", "branch": "wt/BT-072", "sessions": ["20261001_220840_7899d3"]}
